# Sharpened log: a square pyramid over a full block, apex 1 block up.
# Units are blocks: Forge's OBJ loader uses positions as-is. Facets are CCW from
# outside with outward normals; the base faces down and auto-culls against the log.
mtllib sharpened_log.mtl
o sharpened_log
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 0 1
v 0 0 1
v 0.5 1.0 0.5
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0.5 1
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vn 0.0 0.447214 -0.894427
vn -0.894427 0.447214 0.0
vn -0.0 0.447214 0.894427
vn 0.894427 0.447214 0.0
vn 0 -1 0
usemtl facet
f 2/1/1 1/2/1 5/3/1
f 1/1/2 4/2/2 5/3/2
f 4/1/3 3/2/3 5/3/3
f 3/1/4 2/2/4 5/3/4
usemtl base
f 1/4/5 2/5/5 3/6/5 4/7/5
